null/
.nf-test*
.nf-test.*
test_results
test_*
# Whitelist test fixtures that the pipeline tests depend on, even
# though their filenames match the ``test_*`` prefix.
#
# The blanket ``test_*`` above matches at any depth, so it silently
# excluded every fixture named test_something. Two directories were
# whitelisted individually; tests/fixtures/validation/ was missed, so
# test_genomes.json, test_kraken_output.txt and test_classified.fastq
# were never in the repository. Every validation test therefore passed
# locally, where the files exist, and failed on a fresh clone with
# "No such file or directory" -- which is exactly what CI is. Nobody
# saw it because CI had never run.
#
# Whitelisting the fixtures directory as a whole rather than adding a
# third per-directory exception: a fixture is by definition something
# the tests need present.
# Anything under tests/, and any fixtures directory anywhere.
!tests/**/test_*
!tests/test_*
!**/fixtures/test_*
!**/fixtures/**/test_*

